  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">10 Women Friendly Public Health Centers in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">What if you could have a role in providing healthcare services that are suitable for women especially in underprivileged areas? The Women Friendly Services project enables women all over Egypt to have access to safe, accessible and acceptable healthcare services. This is done by supporting the existing public health centers and enabling them with all the necessary training, equipment and referral systems to meet the needs and expectations of local women without stigma or discrimination.</narrative>
  </description>
